",["$","code",null,{"children":"Asia/Karachi"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Asia/Dhaka"}],", or ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Asia/Dubai"}],") is read client-side to automatically display relevant regional prayer schedules. This prevents unnecessary manual city switching while keeping identity completely anonymous."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Direct Correspondence Data:"}]," When you voluntarily submit feedback, submit mosque timetables, or report astronomical calculation discrepancies through our ",["$","$L1e",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"text-brand-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold underline","children":"Contact Portal"}],", we collect your provided full name, email address, optional city, inquiry classification, and message text. This data is utilized strictly by our editorial and verification scholars to investigate and reply to your inquiry."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Administrative Credentials:"}]," For authorized editorial personnel accessing ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/admin"}],", we store the username, administrative display name, cryptographic salt, and PBKDF2/SHA-256 password hash in Cloudflare D1. Plaintext passwords are never recorded or recoverable."]}]]}]]}]
